 (PHASE/'README.md').write_text('# C035 / HD128582: complete\n\nOne original record, six own January–July observations, 14 profiles and 28 comparisons. Surroundings favor barycentric correlation and RMS in all five nonself pairs. Core preferences are mixed: each quantity favors barycentric coordinates in three of five, with two metric disagreements. Physical U remains; no qualified laser.\n\nAll profiles have full positive-reference support. Separate reconstruction passes 1,182 checks over 54,774 values. The four figure contents and a caption-only corrected raw version are inspected; original frozen outputs remain unchanged.\n\n[Report](analysis/RESULTS_REPORT.md) · [Audit](independent_audit/NUMERICAL_AUDIT.json) · [Closure](GROUP_CLOSURE.json) · [Next C037](NEXT_ACTION.json) · [State](CONTINUATION_STATE.json) · [Caption correction](presentation_label_correction/CORRECTION_RECEIPT.json).\n\nNo added observing time, blind validation or independent agent/human review. Verify live publication and final-head CI before integration.\n')
